{"4829820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alkimya: House of Wisdom", "steam_appid": 4829820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREMISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mongols have taken Baghdad. You are Yusuf, a master alchemist, and your daughter is dying. The House of Wisdom, Baghdad's great library, is burning. Somewhere inside is Iksyr, the only cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/7c75309b922d7f6bf700dbd4ae7c0a48.poster.avif?t=1787765281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/7c75309b922d7f6bf700dbd4ae7c0a48.webm?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/7c75309b922d7f6bf700dbd4ae7c0a48.mp4?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL HORROR IN 1258 BAGHDAD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the horror of the Mongol invasion of Baghdad. Wherever you go in the House, the horde is closing in, a threat that only keeps escalating. And underneath your feet, something otherworldly waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/70253fdbe2a4725b7df0ab89b417128b.poster.avif?t=1787765281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/70253fdbe2a4725b7df0ab89b417128b.webm?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/70253fdbe2a4725b7df0ab89b417128b.mp4?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT, ALCHEMY &amp; CRAFTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with the weapons found inside the House: strange arms, alchemically powered by a cosmic material. Scavenge materials to craft items and flasks that burn, blind, and dissolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/045ce241a345410a879b4d7c960fea90.poster.avif?t=1787765281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/045ce241a345410a879b4d7c960fea90.webm?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/045ce241a345410a879b4d7c960fea90.mp4?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTERCONNECTED LEVEL DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The House of Wisdom is one interconnected space: locked routes, hidden shortcuts, mechanisms built by the finest minds of an age. Solving the space is how you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/a0605a37c655a6660b0087ca763380cd.poster.avif?t=1787765281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/a0605a37c655a6660b0087ca763380cd.webm?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/a0605a37c655a6660b0087ca763380cd.mp4?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STALKER ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face stalker enemies you cannot kill, only evade. Some are faster than you; escape means using the environment against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/1cbbe673ac48aad38b5314d5957d36c9.poster.avif?t=1787765281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/1cbbe673ac48aad38b5314d5957d36c9.webm?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/1cbbe673ac48aad38b5314d5957d36c9.mp4?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror set in 1258 Baghdad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy-driven combat: weapons and flasks powered by the science of a golden age</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interconnected sanctum of locked routes, shortcuts, and Golden Age mechanisms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalker enemies that cannot be killed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative steeped in historical and cosmic horror, with full cinematics and voice performances in Arabic and English</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREMISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mongols have taken Baghdad. You are Yusuf, a master alchemist, and your daughter is dying. The House of Wisdom, Baghdad's great library, is burning. Somewhere inside is Iksyr, the only cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/7c75309b922d7f6bf700dbd4ae7c0a48.poster.avif?t=1787765281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/7c75309b922d7f6bf700dbd4ae7c0a48.webm?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/7c75309b922d7f6bf700dbd4ae7c0a48.mp4?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL HORROR IN 1258 BAGHDAD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the horror of the Mongol invasion of Baghdad. Wherever you go in the House, the horde is closing in, a threat that only keeps escalating. And underneath your feet, something otherworldly waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/70253fdbe2a4725b7df0ab89b417128b.poster.avif?t=1787765281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/70253fdbe2a4725b7df0ab89b417128b.webm?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829820/extras/70253fdbe2a4725b7df0ab89b417128b.mp4?t=1787765281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT, ALCHEMY &amp; CRAFTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with the weapons found inside the House: strange arms, alchemically powered by a cosmic material. Scavenge materials to craft items and flasks that burn, blind, and dissolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas